@startuml diagnostics-sequence
title Planned scenario — From learner activity to the research export and the risk list
skinparam shadowing false

' Planned scenario (docs/07-architecture.md § 7.5). Only the web client screens exist
' today, as wireframes; the API, database and early_warning service are planned.

actor Student
participant "Web client" as W
participant "API /course\n(planned)" as CRS
participant "API /analytics\n(planned)" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n(planned)" as DB
participant "early_warning service\n(planned)" as EW
actor Admin
actor Expert

Student -> W : opens a lesson, answers an exercise
W -> CRS : POST /course/exercises/{id}/attempts
CRS -> DB : insert exercise_attempts row
CRS --> W : correct / wrong, can_reveal
opt research consent given
  W -> API : POST /analytics/events (batch,\nperiodically and on tab close)
  API -> DB : check consent, insert activity_events
end
Admin -> W : Analytics → export
W -> API : GET /analytics/export?format=csv
API -> EW : build research export
EW -> DB : attempts and events of consenting learners only
EW --> API : CSV with HMAC pseudonyms
API --> W : file download
== After data collection and model training ==
Expert -> W : open the risk list
W -> API : GET /analytics/early-warning?rho=0.3
API -> EW : analyse cohort at ρ
EW -> DB : events and attempts up to ρ of the period
EW -> EW : features, sequence patterns, clusters,\ntrained model → risk value and top-3 SHAP reasons
EW --> API : ranked learners with reasons and actions
API --> W : JSON
W --> Expert : risk table with reasons and recommended action
@enduml
